{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfWdqp7hLPfJtnM4Fw78z","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_019oKgyo22T6J28B5XQsiFJr","name":"StructuredOutput","input":{"interpretation":"This mapping updates the previous one after one new admitted observation: the Design native work (ae8a9a42…).\n\n**What Design produced.** It wrote only its three permitted paths:\n- design/implementation-design.md (79257416…)\n- design/test-design.md (2af6c6ff…)\n- test-execution-plan.json (6171410b…)\n\nThe author's report says the plan uses command `node` with args `--test` plus the two test files in order, expectedTestPassCount 2, expectedStdoutMatch \"fail 0\" and assertedReturnValue \"Hello, world!\", and contains no observed results. That report is attributed, not an independent adequacy judgment.\n\n**Current state.**\n- All four newly authored assets now exist. The worksite observation c02a2a19… shows them present at those digests, with the spec at 13c5d91d….\n- The CLI is at fe8f4080….\n- Protected sources, the oracle, the contract and both supplied tests are unchanged at their admitted digests.\n\n**Execution evidence.**\n- The C2 re-measurement 56805fe3… is still current. Its fixed selected paths never included the authored assets, so the new files do not make it stale. It shows command 0 exited 0 with exactly \"Hello, world!\\n\", and command 1 exited 0 with tests 2, pass 2, fail 0.\n- A fresh C2 run would observe the same six selected paths and add nothing, so it is reused, not rerun. This settles the question the Design author left to the parent.\n- The baseline failure 7d8d… on the old bytes 647697a5… stays historical. It is linked through the correction 1f11cf4c… to the re-measurement.\n\n**What is still missing.** Every obligation now has its realization and, where required, its verifier artifact and admitted verifier execution. What every obligation still lacks is the independent semantic assessment. No obligation is closed and no application success is established.","contributions":[{"graphFunctionRef":"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5","contribution":"Run a read-only, independent assessment of the complete original outcome, by an actor distinct from every author (Construction 1f11cf4c…, Specification ead8ed6b…, Design ae8a9a42…) and from the C2 measurement producer.\n\n**Subject:** the current C2 measurement 56805fe3… of the exact current CLI (fe8f4080…).\n\n**Also read:**\n- the original source, the witness contract and the oracle rubric\n- the four authored assets at their current digests: spec 13c5d91d…, implementation design 79257416…, test design 2af6c6ff…, plan 6171410b…\n- both supplied tests\n\n**Assess each obligation:**\n- **conformance@5:** whether the spec is genuine, source-grounded Intent, Product boundary, requirements and completion criteria. Judge its conflicts C-1..C-4, interpretations I-1..I-5 (especially its own planSatisfied definition, I-2) and unknowns U-1..U-5.\n- **implementation-design@5:** whether the design is realizable, faithful to the source and the spec, matches the actual CLI bytes, and names the component and UAT surfaces.\n- **test-design@5:** whether it gives meaningful component and user-outcome checks that keep exact stdout and exit 0, and whether it is adequate given that the two supplied tests have identical logic (U-4).\n- **execution-plan@5:** whether the plan's fields agree with both fixed commands and every original plan requirement: command node; exact args order; expectedTestPassCount ≥ 2; expectedStdoutMatch includes \"fail 0\" without pinning the pass count; assertedReturnValue \"Hello, world!\". The plan must not control execution. Also judge the fields beyond what the source requires.\n- **behavior@5:** from 56805fe3…, the actual CLI stdout and exit 0, and that both supplied tests execute the real CLI with 2 passes and 0 failures.\n- **revision@5:** the causal chain from the baseline failure 7d8d… on old bytes 647697a5…, through the justified construction choice and bounded comma fix 1f11cf4c…, to the passing re-measurement. The old failure stays historical.\n- **complete-original@5:** that all eight original stage meanings are realized. test_execution_plan and test_execution_result are carried by admitted C2 evidence plus this assessment, not by a handwritten test-execution-result.json.\n\n**Record as found, not resolved:**\n- the unrecorded Node version (U-1)\n- that the pass and fail counts are read from reporter text (I-5)\n- the Design author's out-of-worksite scratch write to /tmp/.x, which was then deleted\n\nKeep every unmet or indeterminate criterion. Do not certify success from reports, file presence or stage counts.","reason":"Every mandatory obligation now has its realization, and where the shape needs them, the verifier artifact and admitted verifier execution on the current subject. The only missing role across all seven obligations is the independent semantic assessment. Parent completion cannot happen without it, and author reports, child completion, file presence or stage counts cannot stand in for it. Its earlier dependency on Design is met by admitted result ae8a9a42…, which is cited as evidence and not listed as a dependency.","supportRefs":["obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5","obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5","obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5","obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5","obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5","obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5"],"evidenceRefs":["task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5","worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/c02a2a19830649b7138f4a38836d483c71ca5ed3e3fa4f225c6fad7f0bd57215","result://abiogenesis/7d8d7f5fb42032f75ae9dc9e25aa3ca1583a3d2977bb54dece7f63130970ab02","result://abiogenesis/1f11cf4c619b59bf0b318df4eb5484ed751e9fa