ts realization, and where the shape needs them, the verifier artifact and admitted verifier execution on the current subject. The only missing role across all seven obligations is the independent semantic assessment. Parent completion cannot happen without it, and author reports, child completion, file presence or stage counts cannot stand in for it. Its earlier dependency on Design is met by admitted result ae8a9a42…, which is cited as evidence and not listed as a dependency.\",\"supportRefs\":[\"obligation://default-library-witness/complete-original@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/conformance@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/implementation-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/test-design@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/execution-plan@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/behavior@5\",\"obligation://default-library-witness/revision@5\"],\"evidenceRefs\":[\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\",\"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/c02a2a19830649b7138f4a38836d483c71ca5ed3e3fa4f225c6fad7f0bd57215\",\"result://abiogenesis/7d8d7f5fb42032f75ae9dc9e25aa3ca1583a3d2977bb54dece7f63130970ab02\",\"result://abiogenesis/1f11cf4c619b59bf0b318df4eb5484ed751e9fae66e612c16ce8f9c2b252ec83\",\"result://abiogenesis/56805fe3c08b6090c1bd5f5732dae0052e14fdabf28488db3725f1ab2277704b\",\"result://abiogenesis/ead8ed6b924528167921fc2fb656cf1b61878c0fa0686b96f19acd4692009978\",\"result://abiogenesis/ae8a9a42c04a749138ae9f3501059955874e00cf26024ad691da304f0fc46d43\"],\"dependsOn\":[]}],\"gaps\":[],\"nextGraphFunctionRef\":\"graph-function://abiogenesis/default-library/uat@5\",\"nextReason\":\"All four authored assets exist, and the C2 measurement 56805fe3… of the current CLI is still current. The steel thread is proven end-to-end on the current bytes, so no construction, design or testing uncertainty remains to settle first. The one missing evidence role across all seven obligations is the independent semantic assessment, so UAT is the only step that can move the parent toward closure.\\n\\nUAT uses the C2 measurement as its subject because it is the exact current execution observation of the candidate. The native-work results are consumed as evidence.\",\"nextEvidenceRefs\":[\"task://default-library-witness/s6-original@5\",\"worksite-context-observation://abiogenesis/c02a2a19830649b7138f4a38836d483c71ca5ed3e3fa4f225c6fad7f0bd57215\",\"result://abiogenesis/7d8d7f5fb42032f75ae9dc9e25aa3ca1583a3d2977bb54dece7f63130970ab02\",\"result://abiogenesis/1f11cf4c619b59bf0b318df4eb5484ed751e9fae66e612c16ce8f9c2b252ec83\",\"result://abiogenesis/56805fe3c08b6090c1bd5f5732dae0052e14fdabf28488db3725f1ab2277704b\",\"result://abiogenesis/ead8ed6b924528167921fc2fb656cf1b61878c0fa0686b96f19acd4692009978\",\"result://abiogenesis/ae8a9a42c04a749138ae9f3501059955874e00cf26024ad691da304f0fc46d43\"],\"subjectEvidenceRef\":\"result://abiogenesis/56805fe3c08b6090c1bd5f5732dae0052e14fdabf28488db3725f1ab2277704b\",\"revisionReason\":\"The prior mapping (d9064b4e…) chose Design, which has now run (ae8a9a42…). It wrote only its three permitted files and changed nothing else. All protected sources, the CLI and the spec are still current.\\n\\nChanges in this mapping:\\n- **Design row removed.** Its work is complete and current, and it is cited as evidence without being rerun. Its adequacy is left to UAT.\\n- **UAT selected next** with no remaining dependency, and its subject set to the current C2 measurement 56805fe3….\\n- **UAT's evidence** now includes the Design result and the new worksite observation c02a2a19….\\n- **Decided:** no fresh C2 run is needed, because the fixed selected paths exclude the authored assets.\\n\\nNot changed: the original task, source, oracle, contract, supplied tests and the historical baseline 7d8d….\",\"revisionEvidenceRefs\":[\"result://abiogenesis/ae8a9a42c04a749138ae9f3501059955874e00cf26024ad691da304f0fc46d43\",\"result://abiogenesis/d9064b4ee3f4ff440426e92bc7999ab85a21172604562518ab6d